; labels without colon (new syntax): a name followed by a token at the
; start of a statement is a label - zz is reached twice; followed by one
; of allowtab's tokens (LSL) it is BB2's assignment shortcut: a = a LSL 2
OPTIMIZE 4
n = 0
zz NPrint "x"
n + 1
If n < 2 Then Goto zz
a = 1
a LSL 2
NPrint a
End
